<title>USA: AT&amp;T files for spinoff of NCR to AT&amp;T holders.</title>
<headline>AT&amp;T files for spinoff of NCR to AT&amp;T holders.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>AT&amp;T Corp said Thursday it had filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission for the distribution of all NCR Corp shares to AT&amp;T shareholders in an effort to make NCR a &quot;stand-alone&quot; public company.  </p>
<p>AT&amp;T said it expected to distribute the shares to its shareholders by the end of the year.</p>
<p>It said the filing was part of its strategic restructuring, begun last year when it announced plans to separate into three public companies.</p>
<p>NCR develops information technology products.</p>
</text>
